ent-ActionRenegadeLightning = Sith lightning
    .desc = Releases lightning at the target.
ent-ActionRenegadeArmorPiercingStrike = Armor-piercing strike
    .desc = The next successful hit with an active Renegade sword deals 15 heat and 15 slash damage through armor.
ent-ActionRenegadeDisarmStrike = Disarming strike
    .desc = The next successful hit with an active Renegade sword knocks the item from the target's active hand without stunning them.
ent-ActionRenegadeKnockdownStrike = Toppling strike
    .desc = The next successful hit with an active Renegade sword forces the target prone for 3 seconds.
ent-ActionRenegadeFocusedRage = Focused rage
    .desc = For 40 seconds, move faster, ignore injury slowdown, and halve self-escape and newly applied stun durations.
ent-ActionRenegadeForceChoke = Force choke
    .desc = Prevents one target from moving for 5 seconds, suffocates them, and doubles their weapon spread.
ent-ActionRenegadeSubmission = Force submission
    .desc = Influences a target's mind through the Force, submitting them to the user.
ent-ActionRecallRenegadeEsword = Recall sword
    .desc = Teleports your energy sword into your hands.
ent-ActionRenegadeEswordTeleport = Teleport to sword
    .desc = Teleports you to your energy sword and places it in your hand.

renegade-esword-activation-denied = Only a Renegade can activate this sword.
